<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="JAS" style="id" />
  <para style="h">Yaki</para>
  <para style="toc3">Yak</para>
  <para style="toc2">Yaki</para>
  <para style="toc1">Muhanda a Yaki</para>
  <para style="mt2">Muhanda a</para>
  <para style="mt1">Yaki</para>
  <para style="imt">Kotili Mukanda</para>
  <para style="ip">Muhanda a Yaki ubamonehele we ibila. Hyo hili ndongisili na kwadisili a mabundu ma Kristo ma mali mu toto yoosi. Mabundu ma musonihi muhanda ali mu usonehele, mali peleve, ma Bayudaayo ba Mukristo. Bo baniba, baamibaambana na bipfu bi Bangeleke, ba baaminangimana ipfumu hya Looma.</para>
  <para style="ip">Muhanda a Yaki, li mu umweese dyeele huli ba Mukristo, buni bo baafwana ubita idiingu hya bo hi hyabaambana na imiinu hya bo mu Nzambi. Banga hiitu bali mu uvondo dyeele mo lina huli Nzambi, na Nzambi li mu uva bo lo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 1:2-8">1.2-8</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 1:13-18">1.13-18</ref></char>). Ni mu buuna, bo utwala utelemene moosi ma mu ubaaduba muvumu a muutu: mapasi ma idiingu (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 1:2-4">1.2-4</ref></char>), lehemene li uba isina (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 1:9-11">1.9-11</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 5:1-6">5.1-6</ref></char>), nzala uvanga bubi (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 1:2-18">1.2-18</ref>; <ref loc="JAS 4:1-9">4.1-9</ref></char>), nyeme (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 4:13-16">4.13-16</ref></char>). Musonihi muhanda li mu usilasa maniima: usa hiitu mu Nzambi, hubaamweese isalu. Muutu wu uli na itwadi hi hibwe na Nzambi, afwana umweese hyo mu mavaanga (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 2:14-26">2.14-26</ref></char>). Mavaanga mo, ni uba mutumi linyutu la nde mwakulu mu utelemene bubi. Ni uba kaka mutumi a bana: ukumbasa ba bali na nzala a pasi hyo, uveletsundasa bo tso uvelenangimana bo, ka utsikaha bitoyili (utala mu <char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 3:1-12">3.1-12</ref></char>). Musonihi muhanda li mu usonehele huli baatu, peleve ba baavele bisina (utala mu <char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 2:6">2.6</ref></char>), ka busina bu ubaasoho bo, na bo na nzala ubaha bwo. Musonihi muhanda li mu utuma bo, mu uvelepenye biyaha, mu tooni buyaha bwa bo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 2:1-13">2.1-13</ref></char>). Ka Musonihi muhanda li mu ubweleele: busina buli bu bubi, mu tooni bisalili bi bibi, bi bisina bibaasalila bwo (<char style="xt"><ref loc="JAS 5:1-6">5.1-6</ref></char>).</para>
  <para style="ip">Kumbasanaani, sambilaani mu bana, sahaani na soolwani ba baamiitahuha lala na imbuli. Mono ma tsukusu muhanda ali mu uyabisa ba Mukristo.</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="JAS 1" />
  <para style="s1">Mabwehe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 1:1" />Me Yaki, musalili a Nzambi na wa Pfumu Yisu Kristo, ndi mu upa bwehe huli bibandu kuumi na byole, bi byatsamuha mu matsi moosi.<verse eid="JAS 1:1" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Monwaani kinya mu pasi lobese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 1:2" />Baana bangu a me, monwaani kinya mu pasi lobese lili uyila benu, <verse eid="JAS 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 1:3" />bu liyaabi ti lobese li imiinu hya benu, libaabuta mukonono. <verse eid="JAS 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 1:4" />Ka mukonono a benu afwana usupana mu ukuhasa vanga la nde, mana benu liba ba baakula, ba baakuha, na livelekiima pasi isiha.<verse eid="JAS 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 1:5" />Ni mu buuna, tso muutu mumosi mu benu veli na dyeele, nde avondo lo huli Nzambi, wu uva nde lo. Mu tooni ati, Nzambi ubaava huli baatu boosi mu mutima wu mubwe, hwavele masyembo. <verse eid="JAS 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 1:6" />Ka nde avondo lo mu imiinu, hwavele matsika. Mu tooni ati, wu ubasa matsika, li we po mubu, yi ifula hibaanyngasa na utsyete. <verse eid="JAS 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 1:7" />Muutu wa pila yina, utwala usa matsimi ma uyaka pasi isiha huli Pfumu ve. <verse eid="JAS 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 1:8" />Nde «mbambi malimi moole»<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">1.8 </char><char style="ft" closed="false">mbambi malimi moole: muutu wu ubaasobo matsimi, nga moole-moole.</char></note>, muutu nga matsika.<verse eid="JAS 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Iyaha na isina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 1:9" />Mwana a ngu wu li iyaha abaamono kinya mu tooni ati, Nzambi li mu usyenolo nde. <verse eid="JAS 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 1:10" />Na mwaana a ngu nga busina abaamono kinya mu tooni ati, Nzambi ukulamasa nde. Ka muutu nga busina uvyoho we ifulu hya bwadi. <verse eid="JAS 1:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 1:11" />Bu nyangu hubaapala, mbaahu a lwanga, yibaakanyisa bwadi. Ifulu hibaanengele, hibaabwa, na yoli-yoli a hyo yibaadimbala. Ni bumosi kaka huli isina, nde udimbala ŋa hati li mavaanga ma nde.<verse eid="JAS 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubingala malobese</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 1:12" />Kinya huli muutu wu ubaakunda lobese. Humbisa ubingala lo, nde ubaha mutata a moonyi, wu Nzambi hasiidi nzuhisini huli ba baatondo nde. <verse eid="JAS 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 1:13" />Pasi muutu, a haleele ŋa lobese li miiyila nde ti: «Ni Nzambi miilobese me!» Mu tooni ati, bubi utwala ulobese Nzambi ve. Na Nzambi nde mwakulu a habaalobese muutu ve. <verse eid="JAS 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 1:14" />Ka pasi muutu ubaabwa mu lobese, ŋa linyungi la nde mwakulu libaaduta na libaasoho nde. <verse eid="JAS 1:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 1:15" />Titswene, ŋa linyungi limiiyele, lo libaabuta lisumu. Na lisumu liyele, libaabuta lipfu.<verse eid="JAS 1:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 1:16" />A lipfuta benu mwakulu ve, baana ba ngu a me baa litondo. <verse eid="JAS 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 1:17" />Bungodu bu bungeele bwosi, na bu bwakuha, bubaamata hu yulu huli Nzambi, muvaangi mayalala ma yulu. Na huli nde, tsobili yo ve, nde a habaasobo ve, we bu inzinza hibaatanyuha na ukuukama. <verse eid="JAS 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 1:18" />Nzambi aviidi bisu moonyi. Nde aviidi bisu moonyi mu litondo la nde, na mu likumbasa la mambu ma nde ma mbuli, mana bisu liba we mbutu yatsomi mu byosi bi nde havanga.<verse eid="JAS 1:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Uyuha na usalila mambu ma Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 1:19" />Yaabaani lo, bambaahi ba me baa litondo. Pasi muutu atehe matswi, aba na limama mu utoyo, limama mu udasuha. <verse eid="JAS 1:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 1:20" />Mu tooni ati, kesi a muutu a yibaakuhasa litondo la Nzambi ve. <verse eid="JAS 1:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 1:21" />Ni mu buuna, timbaani mbindu yoosi na mavaanga moosi ma mabi. Yakaani hutso a kulimini, mambu ma Nzambi ma baakuni mu benu, ma mu utwala ufuuhasa benu.<verse eid="JAS 1:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 1:22" />Baasalilaani we bu mambu ma Nzambi mali mu uleele benu. A liba ndulu bayuhi ve. Benu livelesalila mo, benu lu upfuta benu mwakulu. <verse eid="JAS 1:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 1:23" />Muutu wu ubaayuha mambu ma Nzambi hwavele usalila mo, li we muutu wu li mu utala hiinzi hya nde mu limwenu. <verse eid="JAS 1:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 1:24" />Humbisa umono hiinzi hya nde, nde ubaayene, na ubaavusana mu mawasa buni abeedi. <verse eid="JAS 1:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 1:25" />Ka muutu wu ubakengese mu mikele mya tsiki, mikele mi bunyanga, ubaakwilala mu myo. Nde a habaasuka ndulu mu uyuha ve, na a habaavusana myo ve, ka nde ubaasalila myo. Muutu wa pila yiina, umono kinya mu bisalili bya nde.<verse eid="JAS 1:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 1:26" />Tso muutu li mu umonehele we musambili wa mbuli, hwavele ukuta limi la nde, nde li mu upfuta nde mwakulu, inzambi hya nde hya mu pu. <verse eid="JAS 1:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="JAS 1:27" />Inzambi hi hyatsyeme na hi hyavele na tsumiili, ŋa busu bwa wu li Nzambi na Taata, ni mu ubaakumbasa bitsana na bakwili mutso minyongi mya bo. Inzambi hi hyatsyeme, ni mu uvelesumaha mu mambu ma mabi ma tsi mo yiniiyi.<verse eid="JAS 1:27" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="JAS 2" />
  <para style="s1">Uvelesa buraandu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 2:1" />Baana baa ngu a me, a laapfuuta buraandu na imiinu hi lili na hyo mu Pfumu a bisu a benu Nga Muyusu, Yisu Kristo ve. <verse eid="JAS 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 2:2" />Monwaani: isina imosi hyalwata mulunga a wolo na bikutu bi bibaamwedeme. Hyo hiyakoto mutso libundu la benu. Humbisa a kotili a nde, iyaha kaka hiyakoto na bikutu bya mbindu. <verse eid="JAS 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 2:3" />Bu benu lili mu utaasila wu alwata bikutu bi bibaamwedeme, benu lu uleele nde: «We, tsahala ŋa mbuha yi likiinzu yi!» Ka benu lu uleele huli iyaha: «We, baa mu tele ŋana!» Buuve: «Tsahala hu tsina isuusili hya me hya milu!» <verse eid="JAS 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 2:4" />Ni buuna kaka, benu lili mu usa buraandu ŋa hati la benu mwakulu. Benu lili banzonzi banga matsimi ma mabi.<verse eid="JAS 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 2:5" />Yuhaani baana ba ngu a me baa litondo, Nzambi asooli biyaha bya ŋa toto, mana byo biba bisina mu imiinu. Bisina mu imiinu byuba babahi baa mukobe a Ipfumu hi Nzambi hasiidi nzuhisini, huli baa bubaatondo nde. <verse eid="JAS 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 2:6" />Ka benu limiikumba iyaha! A li buni! Bisina ti ni bi bili mu ukwamisa benu, na ubita benu mu manzo ma tsundusu. A ni buuna ve? <verse eid="JAS 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 2:7" />Ni byo bili mu ubaya nduhi yi likiinzu, ya nde wuuna wu uli Pfumu a benu.<verse eid="JAS 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 2:8" />Ubamono ti benu likuhisi mukele Ipfumu hya Nzambi, we bu baasonehe mu Muhanda a Ngidi: «We utondo muna a we, we we mwakulu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.8 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="LEV 19:18">Lev 19.18</ref></char></note>.» Tso benu lisiidi buuna, benu livaangi bubwe. <verse eid="JAS 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 2:9" />Ka tso benu libaamweese buraandu, benu lili mu usa lisumu. Na benu laamiikwayaaba ti laamiidyata Mikele mya Nzambi. <verse eid="JAS 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 2:10" />Ka tso muutu li mu udukala mikele myosi, na bwidi ndulu mu inzandi imosi ŋa hati li mikele, nde miibwa mu mikele myosi. <verse eid="JAS 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 2:11" />Ni mu buuna, Nzambi wu aleele ti: «A hasa mayamba ve», aleele kaka ti: «A haduba ve<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.11 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="EXO 20:13-14">Pal 20.13-14</ref></char></note>». Tso we velisa mayamba, ka we li mu uduba, we li mutsali Mikele. <verse eid="JAS 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 2:12" />Ka toywani na dyataani we baatu ba bu uyaka tsundusu, hu tsina mikele mi bunyanga. <verse eid="JAS 2:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 2:13" />Mu tooni ati, tsundusu yili yi yavele na lingebe, huli baa bubaavelemweese lingebe. Fula-fula lingebe libaabingala tsundusu.<verse eid="JAS 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Imiinu hi hyavele na mavaanga hili hi hyakwa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 2:14" />Baana baa ngu a me, ki kaluha yili huli muutu mu ubaaleele ti: «Me ndi na imiinu», tso nde a hali mu umweese mavaanga ma mabwe ve? Imiinu hya buuna, utwala ufuuhasa nde ve. <verse eid="JAS 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 2:15" />Monwaani: mwaana a ngu buuve kedi veli na hi ulwata, na kondiini byudya bya pasi ilumbu. <verse eid="JAS 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 2:16" />Mumosi mu benu leeli nde: «Yene mu hyenze, lwata ikutu hya piyu, na dya bubwe!» Tso nde leeli buuna, hwavele uva nde bi nde ali na byo nzala mu linyutu, tsoongo a mambu mo maana ki yo? <verse eid="JAS 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 2:17" />Ni bumosi kaka mu imiinu. Tso hyo a hili na mavaanga ma mabwe ve, hyo hili hi hyakwa.<verse eid="JAS 2:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 2:18" />Ka muutu aleele: «We li na imiinu; me ndi na mavaanga.» Mweese me imiinu hya we, hwavele mavaanga. Na me, mu mavaanga ma me, me umweese we imiinu. <verse eid="JAS 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 2:19" />We li mu usa hiitu ti, Nzambi ndulu mosi? Maana ni mambu ma mabwe. Matengo kaka mali na hiitu mo hiina, na mo mali mu utsula likamba.<verse eid="JAS 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 2:20" />Ka we, itsuudu mo hinihi, we afwana uyaba ti imiinu hi hyavele na mavaanga ma mabwe, hili hya mu pu! <verse eid="JAS 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="JAS 2:21" />Nzambi asilisi Abrahami kaaha a bisu a benu. Nde amoni nde muutu wu akuha mu tooni mavaanga ma mabwe, bu nde hayayeholo mwaana a nde Isaki mu bungodu ŋa yulu a diiku la tsuhili bungodu. <verse eid="JAS 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="JAS 2:22" />We li mu umono ti, imiinu hya nde hyakayene butsiitsa na mavaanga ma nde. Ni mu mavaanga mo maana, nde hakuhisi imiinu hya nde. <verse eid="JAS 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="JAS 2:23" />Ni buuna hwavangimi Mabasonehe mu Mabuuku ma Ngidi: «Abrahami asiidi hiitu mu Nzambi, na Nzambi amoni nde wu akuha mu imiinu hya nde<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">2.23 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="GEN 15:6">Mba 15.6</ref></char></note>.» Na Nzambi ateeli nde mbaahi a nde. <verse eid="JAS 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="JAS 2:24" />Benu lili mu umono ti, ni mu mavaanga muutu ubaamonehele wu akuha, ka ndulu a mu imiinu ve.<verse eid="JAS 2:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="JAS 2:25" />Bumosi kaka Rahabi, mukaasu nga mayamba, amonihili wu akuha ŋa busu bwa Nzambi, mu mavaanga ma nde. Mu tooni a bu nde hayaki biluumbi<note caller="+" style="f"><char style="fr" closed="false">2.25 </char><char style="fq" closed="false">biluumbi </char><char style="ft" closed="false">baatu ba Yosuwa hatsindihi mu uyakete tsi a Kanana <char style="xt"><ref loc="JOS 2:1-21">Yos 2.1-21</ref></char>. </char></note>, na bu hafutili byo mu nzila kima. <verse eid="JAS 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="JAS 2:26" />Ni we bu nyutu yi yavele na iluunzi, yili yi yakwa, bumosi kaka, imiinu hi hyavele na mavaanga ma mabwe, hili hi hyakwa.<verse eid="JAS 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="JAS 3" />
  <para style="s1">Limi, iloho hi muutu huvelekuuta</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 3:1" />Baana baa ngu a me, a lisaha uba milongisi mi milahi mya mambu ma Nzambi ve. Benu liyaabi ti bisu baa libaalongese, sa liyaka tsundusu yi yalutala mifudi. <verse eid="JAS 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 3:2" />Bisu boosi libaadunga hu unzuhisini. Tso muutu velidunga mu biyambilili, nde li muutu wu akuha, wu ubaatwala ukuta linyutu la nde loosi. <verse eid="JAS 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 3:3" />Bisu a benu libaasusa mukudu wu itali mu minywa mi baburu, mana bo basiingala bisu a benu. Bu libaasusa mukudu wu itali mu minywa mi baburu, bisu a benu libaasuungaha nyutu a bo yoosi mu nzila. <verse eid="JAS 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 3:4" />Monwaani makuumbi ma nzali, mo mali mamanene. Bifula bi mifudi bibaatsindahala mo. Ka baya lilikeehe libaasuungaha mo mu nzila, na mo mabaayene hu mubiti likuumbi atondi. <verse eid="JAS 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 3:5" />Ni bumosi kaka mu limi la muutu. Lo lili mwa itini hya hoole hi linyutu, ka lo libaaduna bu lo lili tooni mavaanga ma malahi. Tsimaani mwaana a totobo a mbaahu yi yibaatsuha piinda yinene «vyaa»! <verse eid="JAS 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 3:6" />Limi la muutu kaka lili mbaahu. Lo lili, ŋa hati li binama bya nyutu, tsi yitindala ya ma mabi. Limi na mbuha mu linyutu la bisu. Lo libaasumana nyutu a bisu yoosi. Limi libaanyengese idiingu hya bisu hyoosi, bu lo laamiitehele unyenge hu mbeenge a mbaahu.<verse eid="JAS 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 3:7" />Muutu li na matwala ma uba na lituma ŋa yulu bibulu bya pila mu pila: bibulu bya mu piinda, banyunyi, bibulu bi bibaayene mu bali, bibulu bi bili mutso mibu. Byo byosi byaka hutso lituma la muutu. <verse eid="JAS 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 3:8" />Ka limi, muutu kini a hatwali ukuuta love. Mu tooni ati, lo lili iloho hi ibi, hi muutu huveletwala ukeelese, bu lo lili vilu-vilu. Lo laaluula mu myangala mi lipfu. <verse eid="JAS 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 3:9" />Bisu libaasalila limi mu uyusa Pfumu, Taata a bisu. Na bisu libaasalila lo kaka, mu usinga baatu ba Nzambi havanga mu ifwaani hya nde. <verse eid="JAS 3:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 3:10" />Mu munywa mo mumosi hubaapala mambu ma lisyeme na mambu tsingiili. Baana baa ngu a me, a hwafwana ubaaba buuna ve. <verse eid="JAS 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 3:11" />Mutswe a nzali mumosi, utwala upalisa mamba ma matendoho na mamba ma mvwinzini ve. <verse eid="JAS 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 3:12" />Baana baa ngu a me, muti a fiinge utwala ubuta mbutu a olive ve. Buuve muti a vinye mbutu a fiinge ve. Mutswe a nzali wa mamba ma mvwinzini, utwala upalisa mamba ma matendoho ve.<verse eid="JAS 3:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Dyeele li libaamata hu yulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 3:13" />Tso ŋa hati la benu na muutu nga dyeele na buyedi, nde amweese bwo mu ndyatili a nde yimbwe. Nde amweese bwo kaka, mu mavaanga ma kulimini na mu bulembo bwa nde. <verse eid="JAS 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 3:14" />Ka tso benu laaluula mu nyengi na mu livupu li mitsotso, nyahaani umweese muyusu ti benu ni banga a dyeele. A libiyasa imbuli mu upfuta hwa benu ve. <verse eid="JAS 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 3:15" />Dyeele mo liina, a lili li libaamata hu yulu ve. Ka lo lili la ŋa toto ŋa, lo lili li imuutu na li mavupu ma mabi. <verse eid="JAS 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 3:16" />Mu tooni ati, muutu wu aluula mu nyengi na mu livupu li mitsotso, ŋa muvanga a nde, hyayuhu sa himonehele na ndyatili yimbi.<verse eid="JAS 3:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 3:17" />Ka muutu nga a dyeele li libaamata hu yulu, ateehele na mutima wu atsyeme. Titswene, nde atondo isuusi, kulimini na nzuhili. Muutu mo wuuna na kwili lingebe, na upalisa mbutu yimbwe. Nde a hubaasa buraandu ve, na nde a hali kaka na muwala ve. <verse eid="JAS 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 3:18" />Boosi ba bubaatondo hyenze ŋa hati la bo, bubaapalisa mbutu a hyenze na bubaakukaha mavaanga ma mabwe.<verse eid="JAS 3:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="JAS 4" />
  <para style="s1">Susahani huli Nzambi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 4:1" />Midingu na iboho bya benu, huni bili mu umata? Byo bili mu umata mu manzala ma benu ma nyinga, ma mali mu ulwana pasi taangu, mutso mitima mya benu. <verse eid="JAS 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 4:2" />Benu libaanyungala isiha, ka benu utwala ubaha hyo ve. Ni mu buuna, benu lamiivangama mu uduba. Benu libaasaha ubaha isiha, ka benu utwala ubaha hyo ve. Ni mu buuna, benu libaakakana na libaalwana. Benu laavelebaha bi benu lili na byo nzala, mu tooni ati, benu a lili mu uvondo byo huli Nzambi ve. <verse eid="JAS 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 4:3" />Ŋa benu libaavondo, benu libaaveleyaka, mu tooni ati, masambulu ma benu mali we pinda bipolo. Na bi benu libaavondo, bili ndulu bi usalila mu uywatisa manzala ma benu ma mabi. <verse eid="JAS 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 4:4" />Bimbembo mo biniibi! Benu a liyabi ve ti, utondo mambu ma tsi, ni ubelele hwa Nzambi? Ni mu buuna, tso muutu tondi uba mbaahi a tsi, nde aka muboho a Nzambi. <verse eid="JAS 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 4:5" />Benu libaatsima ti, Libuuku la Ngidi mu pu laatoyo ŋa baaleele ti: «Nzambi ubaasa bisu likwabi mu livupu li nde hasusa mu bisu<note caller="+" style="x"><char style="xo" closed="false">4.5 </char><char style="xt" closed="false"><ref loc="ZEC 8:2">Zak 8.2</ref></char></note>.» <verse eid="JAS 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 4:6" />Ka hyese hi Nzambi ubaava, hyabwefulala bunene. Hyo hibaaleele ti: «Nzambi abelele banga isaayi, ka nde ubaava lisyeme la nde, huli baatu banga a kulimini.» <verse eid="JAS 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 4:7" />Ni mu buuna, singalaani Nzambi, bisalaani Saatana, na nde ubata benu. <verse eid="JAS 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 4:8" />Yasusahani huli Nzambi, na nde uyasusaha huli benu. Swahani myoho mya benu, benu baatu banga masumu. Tsyemesaani mitima mya benu, benu banga a moole-moole. <verse eid="JAS 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 4:9" />Baani mu lingebe, lilaani na nyongwaani. Nyaha hyenze hya benu, hikituha ililu, na kinya a benu yikituha lingebe. <verse eid="JAS 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 4:10" />Kulamanaani ŋa busu bwa Pfumu Nzambi, na nde usyenolo benu.<verse eid="JAS 4:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 4:11" />Baana baa ngu, a litatasana benu na benu ve. Woosi wu uli mu utata mwaana a ngu a nde, buuve utsundasa nde, li mu urokolo Mikele na utsundasa myo. Buuna, pasi nde wu utsundasa Mikele, nde a hali mu ubwesalila myo ve, ka nde amiibinuha mutsundisi. <verse eid="JAS 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 4:12" />Ni Nzambi siha li Musundi Mikele, na Mutsundisi. Nde utwala ufuuhasa, tso uduba byosi. Ka we, na we li, mu utsundasa muutu na we?<verse eid="JAS 4:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ubata isaayi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 4:13" />Bunuubu, yuhaani me, benu baa libaaleele: «Loloyi buuve ngwali, bisu lu uyene hu musyenge mo wunuuwu, bisu lu uvyoso ilima huuna. Bisu lu usa mumbungu a bisu, na bisu lu ubaha kaluha yindahi.» <verse eid="JAS 4:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 4:14" />Benu a liyabi ma mu uyiila benu ngwali ve. Mu taangu mo yiina, idiingu hya benu buni hyu uba? Benu lili we libungi, li libaamonehele mu mwaana taangu hole, na libaadimbala. <verse eid="JAS 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 4:15" />Monwaani buni benu laafwana uleele: «Tso Pfumu tondi, bisu lu uba moonyi na bisu lu usa hinihi, buuve hinihi.» <verse eid="JAS 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 4:16" />Ka mu mbuli, benu lili baduni na banga livama. Mbiili ya pila mo yiina, yili yimbi. <verse eid="JAS 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 4:17" />Ni mu buuna, tso muutu yabi uvanga lilibwe, na nde a havangi love, nde li mu usa lisumu.<verse eid="JAS 4:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="JAS 5" />
  <para style="s1">Nzibusili huli bisina</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="JAS 5:1" />Bunuubu benu bisina, yuhaani me! Lilaani, yayanani mu tooni mapasi ma mu ubwila benu! <verse eid="JAS 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="JAS 5:2" />Busina bwa benu buli bu bwabolo, na bikutu bya benu batsyedidi baamiisyehe byo. <verse eid="JAS 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="JAS 5:3" />Wolo na mbongo a benu, byamiiluula mu malali. Na malali mo maana, mu uba huli benu we bambangi baa bu ukese benu. Na mo mu utsuha nyutu a benu yoosi we mbaahu. Buuna ni busina, bu benu laamiitsonzehe mu bilumbu mo bya tsukusu biniibi! <verse eid="JAS 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="JAS 5:4" />Monwaani! Benu a laava pfuta basali ba matsyehe ma benu ve. Yuhaani minyongo mya bo. Bililu bya bo, byamiito natee mu matswi ma Nzambi, Pfumu a tsi yoosi. <verse eid="JAS 5:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="JAS 5:5" />Benu laatsahili ŋa toto, hutso makinya na hutso a bya talu. Benu laanyebi we bibulu bi bali mu utsuha, mbadi bahehe byo makingu. <verse eid="JAS 5:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="JAS 5:6" />Benu laabelisi, benu laadubi wu asungama, hwavele uva nde muswa, wu ukalana linyutu la nde.<verse eid="JAS 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ukeele pfutihili a Pfumu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="JAS 5:7" />Ni mu buuna, susaani pumi baana ba ngu, natee mu pfutihili a Pfumu. Tsimaani musali mangundu: nde li na isusi mu ubaakeele miluunda mya toto mya talu, natee bu nde hu uyaka miluunda myatsomi na bikootele. <verse eid="JAS 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="JAS 5:8" />Benu kaka, susaani pumi, hwadisaani mitima, mu tooni ati, pfutihili a Pfumu yaka bebele. <verse eid="JAS 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="JAS 5:9" />Nyahaani bikumini benu na benu baana ba ngu, kini Nzambi utsundasa benu. Mutsundisi amiikwateleme ŋa munywa a nzo. <verse eid="JAS 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="JAS 5:10" />Baana baa ngu, mimbihuli mi myakatoyo mu nduhi a Pfumu, myakasa mukonono bu baakamono pasi. Volwaani ifwaani hya bo. <verse eid="JAS 5:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="JAS 5:11" />Eye! Bisu libaaleele, kinya huli ba baamiisa mukonono. Benu laayuhi buni Yobi hakuundi pasi. Na benu laamoni tsukusu yi Pfumu hasili nde. Ka Pfumu aluula mu litondo, na lingebe.<verse eid="JAS 5:11" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ngu musamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="JAS 5:12" />Hati a tsomi, baana ba ngu, a lilaba milabu, tso mu yulu, tso mu toto, tso mu pasi ndabili. Ka eye a benu, yiba «eye», naana a benu yiba «naana». Saani buuna, mana benu livelebwa mu tsyembili a Nzambi.<verse eid="JAS 5:12" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Lisambulu li itwadi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="JAS 5:13" />Muutu ŋa hati la benu li na pasi? Nyaha asambila. Muutu mumosi li mu kinya? Nyaha ayimba nyimbu. <verse eid="JAS 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="JAS 5:14" />Muutu ŋa hati la benu li na ubeele? Nyaha ateele bakuutu ba libundu, mana basambila mu nde, na bakuba nde maadi, mu nduhi a Pfumu. <verse eid="JAS 5:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="JAS 5:15" />Lisambulu la nga imiinu, lu ufuuhasa mubeedu mo wuuna. Na Pfumu utelemese nde. Tso nde hasa masumu, nde uyaka kolo-kolo mu mo. <verse eid="JAS 5:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="JAS 5:16" />Baasiingani masumu ma benu ŋa busu bu bambaahi. Na baabitasanaani bana mu masambulu, mana benu libeloho. Ŋa muutu wu akuha ubaasambila, lisambulu la nde, libaaba na mifudi.<verse eid="JAS 5:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="JAS 5:17" />Eliya aba muutu we bisu a benu. Nde asambili na mukonono mana mvula avelenoho ŋa toto. Buuna, bilima bitatu na batsungi basamunu, mvula a hanohi ŋa toto ve. <verse eid="JAS 5:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="JAS 5:18" />Titswene, nde abwesambila na Nzambi anohisi mvula, toto yabuti mimbutu.<verse eid="JAS 5:18" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Usaha na uyafutala ba baadimbala mu nzila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="JAS 5:19" />Baana baa ngu a me, tso muutu mumosi ŋa hati la benu tahuhi na imbuli, yaabaani ti mukima utwala uyafutala nde. <verse eid="JAS 5:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="JAS 5:20" />Muutu wu ubaayafutala musumihi mo wuuna mu nzila, ufuuhasa muvumu a nde mu lipfu, na ufungala limya li masumu.<verse eid="JAS 5:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="JAS 5" />
</usx>